    "step5_reality_check": {
      "0": "Screenshots show the site\u2019s results page with a clear \u201cSearch Details\u201d line stating the query as \u201cType 2 Diabetes,\u201d and a paginated results list (\u201cViewing 1-10 out of 304 studies\u201d). Individual results commonly display the condition tag as \u201cType II Diabetes Mellitus,\u201d which appears to be how the site labels Type 2 diabetes within cards/rows.",
      "1": "The evidence consistently shows Recruiting and United States as applied via the \u201cSearch Details\u201d line (\u201cIn United States | Recruiting studies\u201d) and/or a checked Recruiting box plus a Location field containing \u201cUnited States.\u201d However, when the \u201cStudy Phase\u201d facet is visible, the \u201cPhase 3 (30)\u201d checkbox appears empty/unchecked in the screenshots; there is no visible chip/breadcrumb indicating Phase 3 is active.",
      "2": "Sorting controls appear to exist under a \u201cDisplay\u201d panel/button. One screenshot explicitly shows a sort setting where \u201cRelevance\u201d is selected and \u201cNewest First\u201d is not. Across other screenshots, the sort menu is not open and there is no on-page indicator that sorting is by \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d specifically; \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d is not visible as a selectable sort field in the captured views.",
      "3": "For the top listed study, NCT number, title, and a green \u201cRecruiting\u201d badge are visible on the result card/row. The missing element is the \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d value: it is not displayed anywhere on the visible cards/rows in the provided screenshots, so that field cannot be verified from the list view shown.",
      "4": "For the second listed study, the screenshots similarly show NCT number, title, and \u201cRecruiting\u201d badge on the card. As with result #1, the list view shown does not display a \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d date on the card/row, so the required date field is not visible to record from the evidence.",
      "5": "For the third listed study, NCT number and \u201cRecruiting\u201d badge are visible; the title is sometimes truncated/cut off depending on scroll position (in some screenshots only the beginning is visible). No \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d date is shown on the visible portion of the third card/row in any screenshot.",
      "6": "Screenshots show no evidence of prohibited actions (no contacting, saving, or submitting). Buttons/links like \u201cSave,\u201d \u201cFind Contact Information,\u201d and \u201cCheck who can join\u201d are visible but not shown as used. The interface shows \u201cClear Filters (3)\u201d and \u201cApply Filters,\u201d indicating some filters are active, but the required Phase 3 selection and the required newest-first Last Update sorting are not visibly confirmed in the screenshots, and \u201cLast Update Posted\u201d dates are not visible on the result list view captured."
